slug: "social-roleplay-blocks"
title: "Roleplay Blocking (rpblock & rpunblock)"
category: "social"
excerpt: "Stop specific members from using roleplay commands on you with .rpblock and .rpunblock."
tags: ["roleplay","privacy","blocks","social"]
